<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Runtime protocol catalog for Protocol Analyzer.

  To translate an item without changing its stable wire code, turn the
  self-closing element into a pair and add, for example:

    <translation language="de" name="Status"
                 category="Status"
                 description="Eine ADC-Statusantwort." />

  The loader tries the user's full locale, its base language, the catalog's
  default language, and finally the text on the command/feature/field itself.
  New valid ADC or NMDC command entries are recognized immediately and decoded
  generically. Complex command semantics remain in the bounded C++ parsers.
-->
